  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a20105d88834d764380d6090e8c10179, type: 3}
  m_Name: Letter from Hellen
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  title: Letter from Hellen
  content: 'Dear Clara,


    Lily still talks about Frostmere almost every evening.

    She''s
    nearly finished the field guide you sent her and insists on teaching Elian the
    proper names for every flower she finds.

    He still calls them "the purple
    one" and "the yellow one."

    We hope to visit after the harvest if everything
    goes well.


    Thank you for believing in her.

    It means more than you
    know.


    With love,

    Hellen'
